flowchart TD
    A[User asks academic question] --> B{Need personal data or multi-step validation?}
    B -- "No" --> C[Baseline Chatbot]
    C --> D[Explain general credit and registration rules]
    B -- "Yes" --> E[ReAct Agent]
    E --> F[Thought: identify missing evidence]
    F --> G[Action: call registered academic tool]
    G --> H[Observation: tool result]
    H --> I{More checks required?}
    I -- "Yes" --> F
    I -- "No" --> J{All constraints valid?}
    J -- "No" --> K[Safe fallback: explain missing prerequisite, conflict, invalid course, or load issue]
    J -- "Yes" --> L[Final Answer: verified course eligibility or study plan]
    E --> M{Provider/tool timeout, malformed action, or MAX_ITERATIONS?}
    M -- "Yes" --> K
    M -- "No" --> F
